# Mixer – Downloads & Updates

This repository hosts the official releases of **Mixer**, a modern virtual audio mixer
and recording studio for Windows (32-bit float processing, Dante Virtual Soundcard
support, multitrack recording, effects, VST3, MIDI controllers and MP3 export).

## Download

Get the latest version from the [Releases](../../releases/latest) page:

* **Mixer-Setup-x.y.z-x64.exe** – the installer (recommended; updates itself).
* **Mixer-x.y.z-win64-portable.zip** – portable version, no installation.

Installed copies of Mixer check for new versions automatically and update with one click.

---

## אראפנעמען

די נייסטע ווערסיע פון Mixer געפינט זיך אויפן [Releases](../../releases/latest) בלאט.
נעמט דעם **Mixer-Setup** פייל און אינסטאלירט. נאכדעם קומען אלע אפדעיטס אליין.
